---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Matteo Spinelli (matt3o) — maker, designer of custom mechanical keyboards and keycap profiles, Linux enthusiast, and open-source advocate."
>
  <article class="about-page terminal-box">
    <div class="terminal-box-header">
      <div class="about-top-left">
        <span class="terminal-dots" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </span>
        <span>matt3o@workshop: ~/about.md</span>
      </div>
      <span class="about-status">chmod 644</span>
    </div>

    <div class="about-body prose">
      <h1><span class="prompt-prefix">$</span> whoami</h1>

      <p>
        Hi, my name is <strong>Matteo Spinelli</strong> and this is my blog since
        2016. After 10 years of ramblings about mechanical keyboards, 3D printing,
        retro-computing, coding, ... I guess it was time for a change.
      </p>

      <p>
        Internet is a very different place now, hell, 2016 feels like a
        different life. We are in the middle of the AI bubble and creating
        original content may seem superfluous if not stupid. I argue that actual
        human generated content has never been so important. They want me to
        believe that everything is easier and faster with AI, but nothing worth
        doing has ever been easy.
      </p>

      <p>
        Attention span is also very short nowadays and content is consumed in
        video format, if it's written you rarely have more than 2 lines to tell
        the whole story.
      </p>

      <p>
        So why even bother keeping such an antiquated medium alive? Well, on one
        side we need to feed the AI with new original data. If we all stop
        creating the models will be closed in a loop forced to feed themselves
        with more generated data and the result will be a diluted slop. So let's
        give them some original data once in a while.
      </p>

      <p>
        On the other hand I hope there's still someone interested in reading. I
        haven't done much noteworthy lately --I know-- but I'll try to post
        more, hopefully also some new videos.
      </p>

      <h2>What you'll find here</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Mechanical Keyboards &amp; Keycaps:</strong> My beloved keycap profiles,
          like <a href="/tags/mt3">MT3</a>, <a href="/tags/mtnu">MTNU</a>, <a
            href="/tags/pbs">PBS</a
          > and all the others. And my reviews and ramblings about mechanical keyboards.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>DIY &amp; 3D Printing:</strong> I use 3D printing a lot for prototyping.
          Here you'll find my experience with this amazing technology.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Linux &amp; Open Source:</strong> Mostly dedicated to Self-hosted
          services that respect user freedom.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Laser &amp; Ninjas &amp; Shit:</strong> And honestly whatever comes
          to mind.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Links &amp; Contact</h2>

      <div class="about-actions">
        <Button
          href="https://discord.gg/matt3o"
          variant="primary"
          icon="external"
          external
        >
          Discord Community
        </Button>
        <Button
          href="https://mastodon.social/@cubiq"
          variant="outline"
          icon="external"
          external
        >
          Mastodon (@cubiq)
        </Button>
        <Button
          href="https://www.youtube.com/@matt3o"
          variant="outline"
          icon="external"
          external
        >
          Youtube (@matt3o)
        </Button>
        <Button
          href="https://github.com/cubiq"
          variant="outline"
          icon="code"
          external
        >
          GitHub (@cubiq)
        </Button>

        <span id="email-slot" class="email-slot">
          <button
            type="button"
            id="email-reveal-btn"
            class="email-reveal-btn"
            aria-label="Reveal email address"
          >
            <span class="btn-icon" aria-hidden="true">[@]</span>
            <span>Reveal Email</span>
          </button>
        </span>

        <Button href="/rss.xml" variant="ghost" icon="arrow"> RSS Feed </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const revealBtn = document.getElementById("email-reveal-btn");
  const emailSlot = document.getElementById("email-slot");

  revealBtn?.addEventListener(
    "click",
    () => {
      // XOR-encoded char codes for 'hi@matt3o.com' (key: 42)
      const encoded = [66, 67, 106, 71, 75, 94, 94, 25, 69, 4, 73, 69, 71];
      const addr = encoded.map((b) => String.fromCharCode(b ^ 42)).join("");

      if (!emailSlot) return;
      emailSlot.innerHTML = "";

      const mailLink = document.createElement("a");
      mailLink.href = `mailto:${addr}`;
      mailLink.className = "email-revealed-link";
      mailLink.textContent = `[@] ${addr}`;

      const copyBtn = document.createElement("button");
      copyBtn.type = "button";
      copyBtn.className = "email-copy-btn";
      copyBtn.textContent = "[copy]";
      copyBtn.setAttribute("aria-label", "Copy email address to clipboard");

      copyBtn.addEventListener("click", async () => {
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(addr);
          copyBtn.textContent = "[copied!]";
          setTimeout(() => {
            copyBtn.textContent = "[copy]";
          }, 1800);
        } catch {
          copyBtn.textContent = "[error]";
        }
      });

      emailSlot.appendChild(mailLink);
      emailSlot.appendChild(copyBtn);
    },
    { once: true },
  );
</script>

<style>
  .about-top-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .about-status {
    color: var(--term-green);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .about-body {
    padding: 1.75rem 1.85rem;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .neofetch-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: var(--bg-code);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .neofetch-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .ascii-art {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    background: transparent !important;
    border: 0 !important;
  }

  .sysinfo-list {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .sysinfo-list div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 95px 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .sysinfo-list dt {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .sysinfo-list dt::after {
    content: ":";
  }

  .sysinfo-list dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .about-actions {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .email-slot {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0.35rem 0.5rem 0.35rem 0;
  }

  .email-reveal-btn,
  .email-revealed-link,
  .email-copy-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .email-reveal-btn {
    background-color: var(--bg-surface);
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);
  }

  .email-reveal-btn:hover,
  .email-reveal-btn:focus-visible {
    background-color: var(--accent-dim);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-bright);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  :global(.email-revealed-link) {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    text-decoration: none;
    background-color: var(--accent);
    color: #14171c;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
  }

  :global(.email-revealed-link:hover) {
    background-color: var(--accent-bright);
    border-color: var(--accent-bright);
    color: #14171c;
  }

  :global(.email-copy-btn) {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  :global(.email-copy-btn:hover) {
    color: var(--accent-bright);
    border-color: var(--accent-border);
  }
</style>
